WEBVTT

00:00:00.115 --> 00:00:05.971
This video shows how to add a book to the catalog on a phone, and how to find it again.

00:00:07.647 --> 00:00:14.103
Tap the menu button, open Library and choose Catalog. Then tap Add Book.

00:00:24.938 --> 00:00:36.266
Enter the title, Pakistan Studies Grade 5, and the author, Dr. Ayesha Malik. Both are required. Then enter the ISBN and the publisher.

00:00:50.132 --> 00:00:58.964
Scroll down. Choose the category, History, set the total copies to 4, and type the shelf location, D-7.

00:01:00.083 --> 00:01:08.531
Tap Add Book. A message confirms it, and the new book appears in the catalog as a card showing its available copies.

00:01:26.958 --> 00:01:36.078
To find a book, type part of its title, author or ISBN in the search box. Here, alg shows Algebra Made Easy.

00:01:44.002 --> 00:01:50.266
Clear the search and pick a category, Mathematics, to see only that section of the library.

00:02:05.999 --> 00:02:09.743
The new book is in the catalog and ready to be issued.
